    "originalNumber": 153,
    "question_tr": "حجك واجبلرى نەلردر؟",
    "answer_tr": "<div class=\"ans-block\">\n<p class=\"ans-p\">١- صفى ايله مروه تپه لرى آراسنده قوشمق (سعى)،<br>٢- مزدلفه ده وقفه ياپمق،<br>٣- شيطان طاشلامق،<br>٤- قربان كسمك (حج قران وتمتع ايچون)،<br>٥- طيراش اولمق،<br>٦- طواف صَدَرْ ياپمق.</p>\n<div class=\"v-flow-box\"><div class=\"v-flow-header\">حجك ياپيليشى</div><div class=\"v-flow-chain\"><div class=\"v-step-card is-origin\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">1</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">مقدس بلده يه انتقال</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">2</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">بيت اللهى ايلك زيارت و طواف (إفرادده طواف قدوم، تمتع و قرانده عمره طوافى)</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">3</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">عمره نك سعيى</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">4</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">ترويه كونى منى يه انتقال، بش وقت نماز منى ده</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">5</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">عرفاتده وقفه</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">6</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">مزدلفه وقفه سى، صوكره منى يه كچيش</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">7</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">بايرامك ايلك كونى بيوك شيطانه يدى طاش</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">8</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">قربان كسيلمه سى، طيراش اولوب احرامدن چيقمق</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">9</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">زيارت (إفاضه) طوافى و واجب سعى</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">10</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">بايرامك ايكنجى و اوچنجى كونى كوچوك، اورته و بيوك جمره لره يدى شر طاش</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">←</span><div class=\"v-step-card is-final\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">11</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">وداع طوافى</span></div></div></div>\n</div>",
    "question_id": "Apa saja wajib-wajib haji?",
    "answer_id": "<div class=\"ans-block\">\n<p class=\"ans-p\">1- berlari-lari kecil di antara bukit Shafa dan Marwah (sa'i),<br>2- wukuf di Muzdalifah,<br>3- melempar jumrah,<br>4- menyembelih kurban (untuk haji qiran dan tamattu'),<br>5- bercukur,<br>6- melakukan tawaf shadar.</p>\n<div class=\"v-flow-box\"><div class=\"v-flow-header\">Tata Cara Pelaksanaan Haji</div><div class=\"v-flow-chain\"><div class=\"v-step-card is-origin\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">1</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Berangkat menuju Tanah Suci</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">2</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Ziarah pertama ke Baitullah dan tawaf (ifrad: tawaf qudum; tamattu' dan qiran: tawaf umrah)</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">3</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Sa'i umrah</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">4</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Hari Tarwiyah berangkat ke Mina; salat lima waktu di Mina</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">5</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Wukuf di Arafah</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">6</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Wukuf di Muzdalifah, lalu menuju Mina</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">7</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Hari pertama Iduladha: 7 batu ke Jumrah Aqabah (setan besar)</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">8</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Menyembelih kurban, bercukur, lalu keluar dari ihram</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">9</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Tawaf ziarah (ifadhah) dan sa'i yang wajib</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">10</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Hari ke-2 dan ke-3 Id: masing-masing 7 batu ke jumrah kecil, tengah, dan besar</span></div><span class=\"v-step-arrow\">→</span><div class=\"v-step-card is-final\"><span class=\"v-step-tag\">11</span><span class=\"v-step-word\">Tawaf wada'</span></div></div></div>\n</div>",
